        "original_id": "d1a93afb-516c-5748-a060-3cf487e7cd84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Belle Gold, Emilie de Ravin\n- Works: Once Upon a Time\n- Roles: Lacey\n- Topics: fictional characters, casting\n\nFacts:\n- Belle Gold, née French, is a fictional character in ABC's television series Once Upon a Time.\n- Belle Gold was briefly known as Lacey in Once Upon a Time.\n- Emilie de Ravin was born on 27 December 1981 and is an Australian actress.\n- Emilie de Ravin portrays Belle Gold in Once Upon a Time.\n- Emilie de Ravin appeared in a recurring role in the first season of Once Upon a Time.\n- Emilie de Ravin became a series regular on Once Upon a Time from the second season onward.\n- Belle Gold became a fan favorite after her debut in Once Upon a Time.",
